      "updated": 1777219377982,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Resolve problems\n1) global counter resolve two problems\n i) not single point of failure\n ii) scalling easy\n iii) Not overload it is fast in distributed enviorment\n\n2) Separate TinyUrlService\n i) write to write url\n ii) read to read url \nNot over load sing service\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Resolve problems\n1) global counter resolve two problems\n i) not single point of failure\n ii) scalling easy\n iii) Not overload it is fast in distributed enviorment\n\n2) Separate TinyUrlService\n i) write to write url\n ii) read to read url \nNot over load sing service\n",
